{"headword":"עַ֫יִן²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. spring</strong> (of water) <strong>(</strong>connexion with i. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> dub.; NH id., Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ען</span>; Assyrian <em>ênu, înu;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">عَيْنٌ</span>; Ethiopic ዐይን; Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">עינא</span>, 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיְינָא</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܥܰܝܢܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 29:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.29.1\">1 S 29:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָ֑יִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:22\" href=\"/Genesis.49.22\">Gn 49:22</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַ֫יְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:16\" href=\"/Genesis.24.16\">24:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:45\" href=\"/Genesis.24.45\">45</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:13\" href=\"/Genesis.24.13\">13</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲיָנֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.7\">Dt 8:7</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">וֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.3\">2 Ch 32:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:9\" href=\"/Numbers.33.9\">Nu 33:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עִינוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.28\">Pr 8:28</a> (Ges<sup>§93 v</sup>);—<em>spring</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:7\" href=\"/Genesis.16.7\">Gn 16:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:16\" href=\"/Genesis.24.16\">24:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:29\" href=\"/Genesis.24.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:30\" href=\"/Genesis.24.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:42\" href=\"/Genesis.24.42\">42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:45\" href=\"/Genesis.24.45\">45</a> (all J) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:22\" href=\"/Genesis.49.22\">49:22</a> (poem in J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 29:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.29.1\